{"type":"message","id":"8e0d3787","parentId":"aaab8748","timestamp":"2026-04-05T15:38:54.787Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Based on the search results, I can now provide a comprehensive answer. The key findings are:\n\n1. \"Trump death\" rumors have been circulating on social media (X/Twitter), particularly around April 4-5, 2026\n2. The White House has responded to these rumors, denying them\n3. This follows a similar pattern from September 2025 when similar rumors also went viral\n4. Multiple fact-checking articles (Times Now, News18, IBTimes) are debunking the claims as false\n5. People.com reports the White House responded to rumors about hospitalization\n6. The rumors seem to have started on Saturday, April 4, 2026 (which is yesterday from the current date of April 5, 2026)\n\n\n7. These claims have been completely unfounded and the White House has officially denied them","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]刚搜了一圈，**是谣言，特朗普没死。** 🚫\n\n事情是这样的：\n\n1. **4月4日（昨天）**，X平台上一堆账号突然发帖说特朗普被送往沃尔特·里德医院，道路封闭、白宫没回应、\"万斯总统\"都上热搜了\n2. **白宫已正式回应**，否认了住院和去世的说法\n3. 多家外媒（People、News18、IBTimes等）已做**事实核查，认定为假消息**\n\n⚠️ 这次谣言的套路跟去年9月那波如出一辙：\n- 用匿名\"内部人士\"爆料\n- 伪造新闻截图\n- 拿2024年枪击事件后的旧视频冒充最新画面\n- 因为白宫几天没安排公开行程就大做文章\n\n**结论：假消息，别传了。** 现在这种AI造谣成本太低，看到\"突发\"\"内部消息\"这类关键词先打个问号准没错 👀"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/free","usage":{"input":16041,"output":591,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16632,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775403523167,"responseId":"gen-1775403523-jnhcivMosTojb5XfKZN2"}}
